WEBVTT

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:52.845
Why did I throw my gun away?

00:01:54.615 --> 00:01:58.643
'Cause I saw him stop a polar
bear with his bare hands.

00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:03.466
Can ya believe it?

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.870
A person beating the snot
out of a polar bear!

00:02:06.894 --> 00:02:09.305
A 700-kilogram polar bear -

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:13.343
didn't think any animal
on Earth could beat one.

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:16.234
They're even known
as guardian deities!

00:02:16.937 --> 00:02:18.982
What kind of polar bear?

00:02:19.006 --> 00:02:21.737
You've been looking at
it this whole time.

00:02:22.843 --> 00:02:25.422
Right here.

00:02:25.446 --> 00:02:27.791
So big that you didn't see it?

00:02:27.815 --> 00:02:32.696
The thing's over 720 kilograms.
This is a guardian deity.

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.298
It sure howled, it did.

00:02:35.322 --> 00:02:38.986
Got pummeled and kicked
like you wouldn't believe...!

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:51.214
Once a hunter sees something
like that, it's all over.

00:02:51.238 --> 00:02:56.720
Facing your prey with only a
gun is the pride of us hunters.

00:02:56.744 --> 00:02:58.712
But he was different...

00:03:02.816 --> 00:03:06.996
When I saw his back, I was stunned.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:11.234
It was a demon.
It was no hallucination!

00:03:11.258 --> 00:03:14.838
A demon - an ogre - was smiling back...!

00:03:14.862 --> 00:03:20.858
"Demon”

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.308
Yujiro!

00:03:48.162 --> 00:03:49.527
It can't be...!

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:03.209
Dad...!

00:04:04.545 --> 00:04:06.411
He's...?!

00:04:07.381 --> 00:04:11.579
Yujiro Hanma...!

00:04:15.956 --> 00:04:18.152
Good to see you again, Baki.

00:04:25.132 --> 00:04:27.624
Why is he here...?!

00:04:31.138 --> 00:04:35.598
Good, I made it in time.
Looks like you just started.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:37.907
Dad!

00:04:38.779 --> 00:04:41.391
Just started...?!

00:04:41.415 --> 00:04:44.646
You both only have scratches on you.

00:04:44.985 --> 00:04:50.700
This grisly fight is stilt
in the early stages to him?!

00:04:50.724 --> 00:04:54.661
He really is the strongest
being in the world...!

00:04:55.562 --> 00:04:58.942
<i>What's wrong? Why won't you fight?!</i>

00:04:58.966 --> 00:05:03.096
We're done, Dad.
We already fought enough...

00:05:07.007 --> 00:05:09.752
You're as soft as ever, Baki!

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:12.802
You seriously call this a fight?!

00:05:15.582 --> 00:05:19.662
Sure! I'll fight you!

00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:20.915
Boss!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:26.426
--Yes. I would have no less.
--Hanayama-san!

00:05:48.081 --> 00:05:50.675
<i>It smelled like this on that day.</i>

00:05:57.724 --> 00:06:02.839
The wind's gotten a little cold.
Let's go inside, my wife.

00:06:02.863 --> 00:06:07.810
I'd like to stay like this a little
longer. Is that alright, Eiichi-san?

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:12.715
If you wanted, we could have
this honeymoon last forever.

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:15.051
You're my pride and joy.

00:06:15.075 --> 00:06:17.908
I've decided to do something
that'll win your heart.

00:06:18.679 --> 00:06:20.044
What's that?

00:06:20.914 --> 00:06:23.760
Being invited to an Akezawa Group party

00:06:23.784 --> 00:06:26.845
means having the highest
VIP status in the world.

00:06:27.287 --> 00:06:31.554
Someday, we'll be at the center of
fashionable society the world over.

00:06:32.359 --> 00:06:35.638
Emi, tonight is that first step.

00:06:35.662 --> 00:06:39.175
--I want to introduce you to my colleagues.
--Colleagues?

00:06:39.199 --> 00:06:42.211
My colleagues from all over the world.

00:06:42.235 --> 00:06:47.332
I'll introduce you as the wife
of Akezawa Group's commander.

00:06:56.717 --> 00:07:00.711
This party is basically in your honor.

00:07:05.559 --> 00:07:07.737
When I told them I was getting married,

00:07:07.761 --> 00:07:12.208
all my colleagues put their
busy lives on hold to be here.

00:07:12.232 --> 00:07:13.666
Wow...!

00:07:15.335 --> 00:07:16.996
Incredible!

00:07:19.673 --> 00:07:24.821
--Eiichi! What a wonderful partner!
--Thanks, Bob. It's good to see you.

00:07:24.845 --> 00:07:26.589
Talk about adorable!

00:07:26.613 --> 00:07:30.560
She must've looked stunning
in her wedding dress!

00:07:30.584 --> 00:07:31.710
You all right?

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:35.498
I'm just a little surprised...

00:07:35.522 --> 00:07:38.601
Maybe I'm nervous from
meeting so many people

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:40.603
after yesterday's reception.

00:07:40.627 --> 00:07:44.941
I don't blame you. You did
lead a sheltered life.

00:07:44.965 --> 00:07:45.523
I don't blame you. You did
lead a sheltered life.

00:07:46.066 --> 00:07:50.613
You're just starting to realize
how great the outside world is.

00:07:50.637 --> 00:07:51.714
Yes...

00:07:51.738 --> 00:07:53.816
This is the world I live in.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:58.573
A place where only the
select few reside.

00:07:58.979 --> 00:08:02.392
There may only be 100
people here, but in truth,

00:08:02.416 --> 00:08:07.063
they're all responsible
for making the world turn.

00:08:07.087 --> 00:08:09.265
The world you live in...?

00:08:09.289 --> 00:08:14.337
In Japan, you may have been in a
world filled with top-class people.

00:08:14.361 --> 00:08:22.361
But true celebrities are born surrounded
by people of the highest status.

00:08:22.669 --> 00:08:27.800
Now that you're married to me, you're
qualified to be a true celebrity.

00:08:29.209 --> 00:08:32.355
Welcome to the world of real status.

00:08:32.379 --> 00:08:35.144
Thank you, Eiichi-san...

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.599
The sacred attraction is starting.

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.835
Esteemed ladies and gentlemen!

00:08:45.859 --> 00:08:49.939
Please take great pleasure
in today's special match-up!

00:08:49.963 --> 00:08:54.510
In the red corner,
George Harman - boxing!

00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:59.472
In the blue corner,
Lorient Traci - Traci Judo!

00:09:00.273 --> 00:09:02.952
Is this your first time
seeing something like this?

00:09:02.976 --> 00:09:04.253
Yes...

00:09:04.277 --> 00:09:07.023
Harman is the current
heavyweight champion.

00:09:07.047 --> 00:09:09.058
He's fighting without gloves tonight.

00:09:09.082 --> 00:09:12.495
Boxing and judo are
completely different.

00:09:12.519 --> 00:09:16.632
Fighting styles don't
matter to the truly strong.

00:09:16.656 --> 00:09:18.886
The truly strong...?

00:09:29.903 --> 00:09:31.803
I give up-

00:09:42.782 --> 00:09:44.682
Thirteen seconds.

00:10:15.081 --> 00:10:17.243
What's the matter, Emi?

00:10:33.533 --> 00:10:39.248
I know you. Yujiro Hanma,
supposedly the ultimate mercenary...

00:10:39.272 --> 00:10:41.684
Did you come for our sake?

00:10:41.708 --> 00:10:45.667
Your fashion sense doesn't
seem quite up to snuff...

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:52.261
That's better.

00:10:52.285 --> 00:10:56.279
--Stop it, Eiichi-san!
--You go back to the hotel.

00:10:59.859 --> 00:11:01.088
Why, you...!

00:11:15.909 --> 00:11:18.139
Are you challenging me?!

00:11:18.979 --> 00:11:20.413
Eiichi-san!

00:11:22.749 --> 00:11:23.910
Very well!

00:11:24.818 --> 00:11:27.730
--Lorient!
--I'll take him on.

00:11:27.754 --> 00:11:29.365
But this is-

00:11:29.389 --> 00:11:31.601
For your rudeness to Eiichi Akezawa,

00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:35.118
you will learn what it sounds
like to have your neck snapped.

00:11:41.067 --> 00:11:44.413
Yujiro Hanma. I've heard about you.

00:11:44.437 --> 00:11:48.217
Seems you saw a lot of
action in the Middle East.

00:11:48.241 --> 00:11:51.802
We"ll use Vale Tudo rules.
Is that acceptable?

00:12:03.623 --> 00:12:04.920
His leg...!

00:12:12.532 --> 00:12:14.000
Lorient's been...!

00:12:53.006 --> 00:12:55.017
You haven't said a word.

00:12:55.041 --> 00:12:58.170
Let me guess what
you're thinking about.

00:13:00.213 --> 00:13:02.443
Yujiro Hanma...

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.262
He was a fascinating man.

00:13:06.286 --> 00:13:09.332
Every woman alive would
want to kneel before him.

00:13:09.356 --> 00:13:11.233
Please stop!

00:13:11.257 --> 00:13:14.870
Why? You thought so too.

00:13:14.894 --> 00:13:17.006
No, that's not true...!

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:19.465
No, you definitely did.

00:13:20.133 --> 00:13:23.679
When that man's extreme
wildness touched you...!

00:13:23.703 --> 00:13:26.182
He's taken you prisoner, hasn't he?!

00:13:26.206 --> 00:13:30.586
It's not just me.
Everyone knows. Everyone saw!

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:35.691
And to top it all off, you let
that total stranger have your lips!

00:13:35.715 --> 00:13:39.083
Stop it! Stop it!

00:13:45.325 --> 00:13:47.453
I came to see you.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.409
Someone help!

00:13:53.433 --> 00:13:55.333
Where is everyone?!

00:14:00.106 --> 00:14:02.097
I knew from the first look.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.757
You love the sight of blood
more than anyone or anything.

00:14:07.781 --> 00:14:11.827
People getting hurt,
stepped on, and dying...

00:14:11.851 --> 00:14:15.865
You long to see that
more than anyone...!

00:14:15.889 --> 00:14:18.768
Get the hell out!

00:14:18.792 --> 00:14:20.226
I'll shoot!

00:14:22.562 --> 00:14:25.588
You don't have to hide it from me.

00:14:42.348 --> 00:14:45.318
Yes. That's a great look.

00:14:48.655 --> 00:14:52.455
You're the woman I've sought after.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.552
Give birth to my child...!

00:15:21.287 --> 00:15:25.568
I'm sorry to ask at a time like this,

00:15:25.592 --> 00:15:29.119
but do you remember who killed him?

00:15:29.462 --> 00:15:32.074
I do...

00:15:32.098 --> 00:15:37.546
Could you describe him for us?
As detailed as possible...

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:39.038
Yes...

00:15:41.374 --> 00:15:43.468
The killer was...

00:15:44.978 --> 00:15:48.710
He was a 2-meter-tall...

00:15:49.983 --> 00:15:53.942
«.old man with white hair.

00:16:07.333 --> 00:16:08.878
Welcome back.

00:16:08.902 --> 00:16:12.515
I'm not sure what to say
in regards to Eiichi-sama...

00:16:12.539 --> 00:16:16.185
I'm fine. Thank you for your concern.

00:16:16.209 --> 00:16:18.234
Yes, Madam.

00:16:19.879 --> 00:16:22.057
Henceforth, I will
follow my husband's lead

00:16:22.081 --> 00:16:26.245
and develop the Akezawa
Group even further!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.455
For 'his' sake too...

00:16:35.695 --> 00:16:39.654
What's wrong? If you want to
fight, then attack already!

00:16:47.106 --> 00:16:48.471
Fool.

00:16:53.179 --> 00:16:54.977
Hanayama-san!

00:16:59.986 --> 00:17:01.818
How cute.

00:17:03.656 --> 00:17:08.237
I heard you're Japan's greatest
brawler at just 15 years old,

00:17:08.261 --> 00:17:10.559
but I guess a kid's just a kid.

00:17:12.732 --> 00:17:14.410
He's a monster!

00:17:14.434 --> 00:17:18.962
He threw the 160-kilogram
Hanayama with just his left hand!

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:23.867
Come. Didn't you want to fight me?

00:17:27.914 --> 00:17:29.391
Boss!

00:17:29.415 --> 00:17:32.441
It's hopeless! He's on a
completely different level!

00:17:39.959 --> 00:17:41.393
Stop!

00:18:01.481 --> 00:18:03.210
Stop!

00:18:11.024 --> 00:18:14.824
Butt out and let me finish him off...

00:18:20.066 --> 00:18:22.344
Still struggling?

00:18:22.368 --> 00:18:25.948
--Damn you...!
--Stay where you are!

00:18:25.972 --> 00:18:28.839
Hanayama-san...

00:18:31.911 --> 00:18:36.371
Come on. The world's strongest
is right in front of you.

00:18:45.625 --> 00:18:48.856
Here. I'll hold you up.

00:18:52.532 --> 00:18:58.630
Should've kept to fighting 3rd-rate
losers instead of challenging me.

00:19:00.606 --> 00:19:03.852
--Horrible!
--He's a demon...

00:19:03.876 --> 00:19:05.954
The boss doesn't know defeat.

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:10.626
But this guy's just too
much to take on...!

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:15.451
Even in top condition, he
still wouldn't stand a chance...!

00:19:25.364 --> 00:19:27.176
Boss!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:30.145
That was a waste of time.

00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:33.264
Boss! Boss!

00:19:36.275 --> 00:19:39.506
A waste...?!

00:20:05.271 --> 00:20:08.206
You did well to make your way in here.

00:20:25.525 --> 00:20:29.018
My beloved world's strongest man...

00:20:35.268 --> 00:20:38.080
You didn't do as I told you.

00:20:38.104 --> 00:20:40.835
I ordered you to raise Baki.

00:20:42.275 --> 00:20:46.922
To raise him in a way worthy
of Yujiro Hanma"s son!

00:20:46.946 --> 00:20:48.157
I did!

00:20:48.181 --> 00:20:50.926
I raised Baki just like you wanted!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:54.096
Top-class coaches, top-class
facilities, state-of-the-art training...

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.248
...for 3 whole years!

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.234
Because he's your son...

00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:02.838
Yes! He's my son! Do you realize that?!

00:21:02.862 --> 00:21:06.441
Top-class? What's top-class
got to do with anything?!

00:21:06.465 --> 00:21:09.211
Only a woman or child
would think that up.

00:21:09.235 --> 00:21:12.261
It's beyond you. I'll do it.

00:21:23.916 --> 00:21:29.855
That's the look. Without it,
you would've been a dull woman.

00:21:36.629 --> 00:21:38.207
I've changed my opinion.

00:21:38.231 --> 00:21:42.566
I want to try chewing on
the Baki you've cooked up!

00:22:44.864 --> 00:22:50.412
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.436 --> 00:22:56.018
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:56.042 --> 00:23:01.690
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.714 --> 00:23:06.695
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.719 --> 00:23:12.234
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.258 --> 00:23:17.773
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:17.797 --> 00:23:23.445
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.469 --> 00:23:28.984
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.008 --> 00:23:34.656
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:40.414
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.162 --> 00:23:51.960
"Next Episode™

00:23:55.968 --> 00:23:57.646
A bond.

00:23:57.670 --> 00:24:02.751
The reason the boys the have
continually fought to the death.

00:24:02.775 --> 00:24:04.252
The father.

00:24:04.276 --> 00:24:07.576
The boy cries out at
the disgraceful insult.

00:24:08.147 --> 00:24:11.393
As the day of destiny
approaches, the heartbeats

00:24:11.417 --> 00:24:15.030
of the dominant and
withering men heighten.

00:24:15.054 --> 00:24:19.924
"Next Episode: Parting Ways"™
